# 28. MOTION SPECIFICATIONS

| Element | Effect | Trigger | Priority |
|---|---|---|---|
| Hero architecture | Jharokha opening | Page load | P0 |
| Hero text | Fade and upward reveal | Page load | P0 |
| City layers | Parallax | Scroll | P1 |
| Main arrow | Curved trajectory | Scroll | P0 |
| Service storefront | Lighting and shutter opening | Arrow arrival | P0 |
| Service cards | Lift and colour fill | Hover/focus | P0 |
| Process route | SVG path drawing | Scroll | P1 |
| Portfolio images | Arch-shaped reveal | Viewport | P1 |
| Portfolio cards | Tilt and zoom | Hover | P2 |
| Statistics | Count-up | Viewport | P1 |
| Testimonials | Carousel | User interaction/timer | P1 |
| CTA buttons | Ripple feedback | Click | P1 |
| Page transition | Shutter wipe | Navigation | P2 |
| Footer skyline | Colour transition | Scroll | P2 |
| Custom cursor | Arch/lotus treatment | Pointer movement | P2 |
| Planner steps | Slide and progress animation | Interaction | P0 |

### Timing guidelines

- Micro-interactions: 150–300 ms.
- Content reveals: 400–700 ms.
- Page transitions: 600–800 ms.
- Scroll-driven motion: controlled by scroll progress.

Animate transform and opacity wherever possible.

### Motion constraints

- Respect reduced-motion settings.
- Avoid excessive camera movement.
- Do not hide content behind animations.
- Provide visible fallback states.
- Allow important carousels to pause.
- Avoid long autoplay sequences without controls.
- Simplify animations on mobile.

