# PART 12 — PERFORMANCE, SECURITY AND ACCESSIBILITY

# 33. PERFORMANCE REQUIREMENTS

The website should be tested on a mid-range Android phone over a 4G connection.

Target Core Web Vitals:

- Largest Contentful Paint: below 2.5 seconds.
- Interaction to Next Paint: below 200 ms.
- Cumulative Layout Shift: below 0.1.

Additional requirements:
- Target homepage weight below 2 MB, excluding separately loaded heavy interactive assets where practical.
- Use AVIF/WebP images.
- Use responsive image sizes.
- Lazy-load below-the-fold assets.
- Load animation libraries only where needed.
- Compress 3D models and textures.
- Optimise draw calls.
- Avoid unnecessarily large texture maps.
- Pause inactive environmental animations.
- Use a static or illustrated fallback for unsupported devices.
- Avoid blocking the main thread with 3D rendering.

The first usable screen should load before the heavy 3D environment.

# 34. ACCESSIBILITY

Target: WCAG 2.2 AA.

Requirements:
- Keyboard navigation.
- Visible focus states.
- Skip-to-content link.
- Semantic HTML.
- Proper heading hierarchy.
- Accessible forms.
- Screen-reader error announcements.
- Descriptive image alt text.
- Accessible dropdowns.
- Pause controls for carousels.
- Reduced-motion support.
- Sufficient colour contrast.

The website must remain navigable without relying on the arrow animation.

# 35. SECURITY AND PRIVACY

Requirements:
- HTTPS.
- Secure form submission.
- Server-side validation.
- Input sanitisation.
- Rate limiting.
- Spam prevention.
- Secure file upload restrictions.
- Controlled CRM access.
- Privacy policy.
- Cookie consent where required.
- Consent records.
- Data retention and deletion procedures.

Design the data flow to meet applicable Indian Digital Personal Data Protection requirements and other relevant privacy obligations where applicable.

Non-essential analytics and advertising tracking should follow the applicable consent requirements.

# 36. BROWSER SUPPORT

Support:
- Latest two versions of Chrome.
- Safari.
- Firefox.
- Edge.
- Samsung Internet.
- Modern iOS and Android browsers.

Fallback behaviour must be provided for unsupported 3D or animation features.

